<D.GARRETT> Well Wil, if you're working in MUMPS, it isn't
                    because you're paid to grind numbers.  We
                    grind lotsa admin-data type stuff.
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> None of Forth, C, Pascal, or Fortran is well-
                    suited for Bignum's.
<D.GARRETT> MUMPS was originally developed to handle hospital
                    data.  Lots of it, from lots of terminals.
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> (nor Mumps)
