<D.GARRETT> we use null strings A LOT in coding... an example of
                    an index array would be......
                    SET ^MAILLIST("Len Morgenstern",1,"phonenum")=""
                    ... that means
                    we don't have your phone number and we want
                    to know about it.... quite ofthen, the actual
                    data is in the SUBSCRIPT, not the node....
                    (that took me about 6 months to get used to,
                    way back)
